WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

This licence covers the code in this repository — the pipeline, the model, the
server and the dashboard. It does not cover, and cannot grant rights to:

  * Football match data, fixtures, results, tables or player statistics. Those
    remain subject to the terms of whichever source they came from. The current
    dataset was compiled from publicly published results and tables for
    commentary and analysis.
  * Football-data.org API responses, if you switch the live provider on. Their
    free tier is for non-commercial use and asks for visible attribution.
  * Club names, colours and any other marks, which belong to their clubs.
    This project draws its own abstract crests from club colours and does not
    use official badges or Premier League trademarks.

If you deploy this publicly and are relying on a third-party data feed, check
that feed's terms yourself before you do. docs/data-sources.md records what was
found when this was written, and terms change.
